      "do": "Start by ~1:30pm for 6pm dinner. Cut kernels off 3 ears; refrigerate kernels; put cobs in the slow cooker. Add chicken, chopped garlic, celery, bell pepper, shallot; butter on top; 1 Tbsp kosher salt, ½ tsp cayenne, black pepper. Cook on low 4–4½ hr. Discard cobs; shred chicken. Stir in kernels, sour cream, sliced scallions, lime juice; season to taste.",
